      "body": "The IOHK fork of `purescript-bridge` is great, and I am attempting to upstream it: https://github.com/eskimor/purescript-bridge/pull/77\r\n\r\nI am aware the fork relies on this Purescript library `purescript-bridge-json-helpers`.\r\n\r\nWould you consider publishing `purescript-bridge-json-helpers` to Pursuit? It would make it easier for `purescript-bridge` to rely on it.\r\n\r\nI would be happy to upload it to Pursuit myself from https://github.com/peterbecich/purescript-bridge-json-helpers, if that is acceptable to IOHK.\r\n\r\nThanks",
